@startuml state-reservation-lifecycle
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica Neue"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam UsecaseBackgroundColor #FFFFCE
skinparam UsecaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #000000
skinparam ActorFontColor #000000
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #000000
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFFFCE
skinparam StateBorderColor #000000
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFCE
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam LifelineBorderColor #000000
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #777777
hide empty description
skinparam ranksep 48
skinparam nodesep 32

title State Diagram - Reservation Lifecycle (cumulative through Iteration 4, behavioral view)\n(red = transition newly driven by iter4 admin refund-review queue)

[*] -down-> Initiated
Initiated -right-> PendingPayment : enterPassengerInfo
PendingPayment -right-> Confirmed : processPayment
PendingPayment -down-> Cancelled : handlePaymentFailure
Confirmed -right-> Ticketed : issueTicket
Confirmed -down-> CancellationRequested : requestCancellation
Ticketed -down-> CancellationRequested : requestCancellation
CancellationRequested -left-> Cancelled : confirmCancellation
Cancelled -down-> RefundRequested : requestRefund [fareRule.isRefundable()]
RefundRequested -[#CC0000]-> Refunded : processRefundDecision(approved)
RefundRequested -left-> Cancelled : processRefundDecision(denied)
Refunded -right-> [*]

note as N1
  Eight ConcreteStates of the State pattern
  (Context = Reservation, -currentState: ReservationState).
  Each state overrides only its allowed transition;
  all other lifecycle events default-reject via
  InvalidStateTransitionException. Legacy ReservationStatus
  enum stays in sync via ctx.updateStatus(...).
end note

note right of RefundRequested #FFF0F0
  <b><color:#CC0000>Iteration 4 change</color></b>
  RefundRequested -> Refunded is now driven by the
  admin refund-review queue (RefundHandler:
  evaluateRefund -> processRefund). The 8-state set
  itself is unchanged from iter3.
end note
@enduml
